  <section class="wb-core" aria-label="Core numbers">
    {{#each coreDetails as |detail|}}
    <div class="wb-core-detail">
      <span class="wb-eyebrow">{{detail.label}}</span>
      <strong class="wb-core-value" {{#if detail.sources}}data-tooltip="{{detail.sources}} · Final overrides still take priority"{{/if}}>{{detail.value}} <small>{{detail.unit}}</small></strong>
    </div>
    {{/each}}
  </section>

  <section class="wb-resistances" aria-label="Resistances and immunities">
    <div class="wb-section-heading"><h2 class="wb-section-title">Resistances &amp; immunities</h2>
      {{#if editable}}<button type="button" data-action="resistances"><i class="fa-solid fa-pen" aria-hidden="true"></i> Edit</button>{{/if}}
    </div>
    <ul class="wb-resistance-list">
      {{#each resistances}}<li>{{this}}</li>{{/each}}{{#each immunities}}<li class="wb-immunity" data-tooltip="Immune">Immune: {{this}}</li>{{/each}}{{#unless resistances.length}}{{#unless immunities.length}}<li class="wb-resistance-empty">None recorded</li>{{/unless}}{{/unless}}
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="wb-resistances wb-dying-details" aria-label="Death and dying">
    <div class="wb-section-heading"><h2 class="wb-section-title">Death &amp; dying</h2></div>
    <p class="wb-hint">Death Threshold {{dying.threshold}}: dies at {{dying.diesAt}} Health. Level + VIT, 5 lower for each Trauma.</p>
    <div class="wb-equipment-fields">
      <label class="wb-override-label"><span>Trauma</span><input
        type="number"
        name="system.dying.trauma"
        value="{{system.dying.trauma}}"
        min="0"
        step="1"
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
      <label class="wb-equipment-check" data-tooltip="Stops Bleeding Out until healed"><input
        type="checkbox"
        name="system.dying.stabilized"
        {{#if system.dying.stabilized}}checked{{/if}}
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      > Stabilized</label>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wb-defenses" aria-label="Defenses">
    <h2 class="wb-section-title">Defenses <span>1 reaction</span></h2>
    <div class="wb-defense-actions">
      <button
        type="button"
        class="wb-block-action"
        data-action="block"
        data-tooltip="Reduce incoming damage"
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      >Block <small>{{block.formula}} {{block.strMod}}</small></button>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="wb-dodge-action"
        data-action="dodge"
        data-tooltip="Avoid an attack or make an area save"
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      >Dodge <small>d20 {{dodgeMod}}</small></button>
      <button
        type="button"
        class="wb-parry-action"
        data-action="parry"
        data-tooltip="DEX 21 · once per round"
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      >Parry <small>d20 {{parryMod}}</small></button>
    </div>
    {{#if worn.heavyDisadvantage}}<p class="wb-warning">Heavy armor: attacks, Dodge and AGL saves have disadvantage.</p>{{/if}}
    {{#each worn.duplicatePieces}}<p class="wb-warning">Multiple {{this}} equipped · review contributions.</p>{{/each}}
  </section>

  <div class="wb-section-heading wb-stat-heading">
    <h2 class="wb-section-title">Attributes</h2>
    <div class="wb-stat-tools">
      <button type="button" data-action="milestones" data-tooltip="Milestone rules and current unlocks">Milestones</button>
      <button
        type="button"
        data-action="statSetup"
        data-mode="generation"
        data-tooltip="Roll 2d6 + 1d12 or type scores, then assign them"
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      >Roll &amp; assign</button>
      <button
        type="button"
        data-action="statSetup"
        data-mode="advancement"
        data-tooltip="4 points at levels 4, 8, 12, 16 and 19; at most 2 in one stat per award"
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      >Stat points{{#if unspentStatPoints}} <span class="wb-badge">{{unspentStatPoints}} left</span>{{/if}}</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section class="wb-stats">
    {{#each groups as |group|}}
    <div class="wb-group">
      <h2 class="wb-group-title">{{group.title}}</h2>
      <ol class="wb-stat-list">
        {{#each group.rows as |stat|}}
        <li class="wb-stat">
          <button
            type="button"
            class="wb-abbr"
            data-action="rollStat"
            data-stat="{{stat.key}}"
            data-tooltip="{{stat.label}} check or save: choose normal, advantage or disadvantage"
          >{{stat.abbr}}</button>
          <span class="wb-label">{{stat.label}}</span>
          <input
            class="wb-score {{#if stat.manual}}is-manual{{/if}} {{#if stat.adjusted}}is-adjusted{{/if}}"
            type="number"
            name="statScores.{{stat.key}}"
            data-stat-score="{{stat.key}}"
            data-base="{{stat.baseValue}}"
            data-default="{{stat.defaultValue}}"
            data-effective="{{stat.value}}"
            data-manual="{{stat.manual}}"
            data-adjusted="{{stat.adjusted}}"
            value="{{stat.value}}"
            step="1"
            aria-label="{{stat.label}} score; edit base score"
            data-tooltip="{{stat.label}}: {{stat.value}}. Select to edit your base score. Clear to reset the manual edit; effects still apply.{{#if stat.sources}} {{stat.sources}}{{/if}}"
            {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
          >
          <span class="wb-mod {{#if stat.negative}}is-negative{{/if}}" aria-label="{{stat.label}} modifier">{{stat.modLabel}}</span>
          <span class="wb-pips">
            {{#each stat.pips as |pip|}}
            <button
              type="button"
              class="wb-milestone-button"
              data-action="milestones"
              data-stat="{{stat.key}}"
              data-threshold="{{pip.score}}"
              aria-label="{{pip.name}}, {{stat.abbr}} {{pip.score}}: {{pip.status}}. View rules."
              data-tooltip="{{pip.score}}: {{pip.name}} · {{pip.status}} · {{pip.summary}}"
            ><span
              class="wb-pip {{#if pip.lit}}is-lit{{/if}}"
              aria-hidden="true"
            ></span></button>
            {{/each}}
          </span>
        </li>
        {{/each}}
      </ol>
    </div>
    {{/each}}
  </section>

  <details class="wb-disclosure wb-adjustments" data-sync="adjust-values">
    <summary>Adjust values{{#if hasAdjustments}} <span class="wb-badge">Custom</span>{{/if}}</summary>
    <div class="wb-adjust-grid">
      <label class="wb-override-label"><span>Hit dice spent</span><input
        type="number"
        name="system.hitDice.spent"
        value="{{hitDice.spent}}"
        min="0"
        step="1"
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
      {{#each resources as |resource|}}
      <label class="wb-override-label"><span>{{resource.label}} maximum</span><input
        type="number"
        name="system.{{resource.key}}.maxOverride"
        value="{{resource.maxOverride}}"
        placeholder="Auto"
        step="1"
        aria-label="{{resource.label}} maximum override; clear for automatic"
        {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
      {{/each}}
      {{#each coreDetails as |detail|}}
      <label class="wb-override-label"><span>{{detail.label}}</span><input
        type="{{detail.type}}"
        name="system.overrides.{{detail.key}}"
        value="{{detail.override}}"
        placeholder="Auto {{detail.automatic}}"
        step="1"
        aria-label="{{detail.label}} override; clear for automatic"
        {{#unless @root.editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
      {{/each}}
      <label class="wb-override-label"><span>Extra Armor Rating</span><input
        type="number"
        name="system.bonuses.armor"
        value="{{system.bonuses.armor}}"
        step="1"
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
      <label class="wb-equipment-check" data-tooltip="Healing consumables may raise Health above its normal maximum."><input
        type="checkbox"
        name="system.health.allowOverflow"
        {{#if system.health.allowOverflow}}checked{{/if}}
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      > Allow Health over maximum</label>
      <label class="wb-override-label"><span>Command AP correction</span><input
        type="number"
        name="system.command.value"
        value="{{commandPool.value}}"
        step="1"
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
      <label class="wb-override-label"><span>Extra Evasion</span><input
        type="number"
        name="system.bonuses.evasion"
        value="{{system.bonuses.evasion}}"
        step="1"
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
      <label class="wb-override-label"><span>Extra movement / AP (ft)</span><input
        type="number"
        name="system.bonuses.movement"
        value="{{system.bonuses.movement}}"
        step="1"
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
      <label class="wb-override-label"><span>Armor AGL penalty</span><input
        type="number"
        name="system.overrides.armorAgilityPenalty"
        value="{{system.overrides.armorAgilityPenalty}}"
        placeholder="{{worn.automaticPenalty}}"
        step="1"
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
      <label class="wb-override-label" data-tooltip="Movement each 5 ft square uses. Heavy armor makes it 10 ft; difficult terrain doubles it."><span>Square cost (ft)</span><input
        type="number"
        name="system.overrides.squareCost"
        value="{{system.overrides.squareCost}}"
        placeholder="Auto {{worn.automaticSquareCost}}"
        min="0"
        step="1"
        aria-label="Square cost override; clear for automatic"
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
      <label class="wb-override-label"><span>Inventory slots</span><input
        type="number"
        name="system.overrides.inventorySlots"
        value="{{system.overrides.inventorySlots}}"
        placeholder="Auto {{carrying.automatic}}"
        step="1"
        aria-label="Inventory slots override; clear for automatic"
        {{#unless editable}}disabled{{/unless}}
      ></label>
    </div>
    <p>Clear an override to use the automatic value. Extra AR and Evasion add to equipped items; final overrides replace the total.</p>
  </details>
  <details class="wb-disclosure wb-help" data-sync="sheet-help"><summary>Rules &amp; help</summary>
    <h3>Stats &amp; resources</h3>
    <p>Click a stat abbreviation for a check or save. Diamonds mark 21 and 28. A stat shows its effective score; select it to edit the base, including earned stat points. Level-up points keep the normal base color. Gear or effects use teal, manual edits gold, and both together purple. Clear a manual edit to restore its remembered base; earned points and active effects still apply.</p>
    <p>{{#if defyFate}}Defy Fate declares a failed check or save successful. Initiative still rerolls.{{else}}Wonder rerolls a non-attack d20. Uses equal your FTH modifier.{{/if}} Use Wonder from a roll's chat card. Each result may use Wonder once; its new result replaces it and may use Wonder again. Long rest refills Health, AP, reactions, Wonder, mana and holy power, plus custom pools set to refill.</p>
    <p>Show mana or holy power under Resources → Manage. Their maxima use current INT or FTH × (level + 2). Custom resources can use any stat or a manual maximum. Settings → Maximum override sets the base cap before bonuses. Clearing it restores the selected source. Current totals follow maximum changes while preserving points spent. Clearing Current fills the pool. Recovery is manual, and hiding a magic pool preserves its balance.</p>
    <p>Minimum override sets the empty bar and spending floor (normally 0); a negative minimum allows spending below zero. Manual Current corrections remain unrestricted. Percentage display runs from minimum (0%) to maximum (100%); action amounts always mean points. Entries and visible totals round down to whole numbers; fractional calculations stay in the background. Hover over the total for whole points and minimum. If maximum is not greater than minimum, percentage is unavailable and Settings keeps Current points editable.</p>
    <h3>Armor &amp; defenses</h3>
    <p>Armor: {{worn.type}} · worn AR {{worn.armorAR}} + shield AR {{worn.shieldAR}} · light armor Evasion +{{worn.evasion}}. Effective AGL {{worn.effectiveAgility}}, armor penalty {{worn.agilityPenalty}}. A square costs {{worn.squareCost}} ft, or {{worn.difficultSquareCost}} ft in difficult terrain.</p>
    <p>Block uses {{block.formula}} {{block.strMod}} STR; another die at level {{block.nextLevel}}. Use arm guards, a weapon or a shield. Dodge uses AGL; Parry uses DEX and normally needs DEX 21 plus held equipment. Each dialog has its own rules section. Apply Health changes manually.</p>
  </details>
